    "turn_idx": 8,
    "turn_text": "You are so, so correct. We definitely thank you for joining us. And I did want to jump right in with. So with something recent, they just passed the COVID bill earlier this month. And my first question for you is, are you for a $15 minimum wage? And if so, would you have wanted that in this COVID bill? Or do you think it should have been separate?",
