        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Including a $15 minimum wage in a pandemic relief package is a plausible and meaningful policy proposal.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The guest understands the distinction between bundling policies within emergency legislation versus keeping them separate.",
