        "text": "I have listened to some of your content on CNBC.",
        "confidence": 0.92
      },
      {
        "text": "The pandemic shifted political momentum in favor of the Democrats.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "I have read an article you wrote.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "In April 2019, you wrote about Democrats losing support among rural voters.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "The Democratic Party needs to recover its image as being for the common good of all Americans.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "Democrats have lost the message that they represent the interests of the people.",
        "confidence": 0.86
      },
      {
        "text": "Republicans sometimes act contrary to the preferences of their own base.",
        "confidence": 0.85
      }
    ],
    "assumptions": [
