        "text": "Effective political messaging is essential for electoral success.",
        "confidence": 0.95
      },
      {
        "text": "Democratic leaders should prioritize reconnecting with working-class and rural constituencies.",
        "confidence": 0.9
      },
      {
        "text": "Public perception of who represents 'the people' is malleable and can be reshaped through strategic communication.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
