    "turn_idx": 31,
    "turn_text": "Well, I think one of the problems, again, with going back to your original question, which was, you know, ACA is kind of the, here's the example of what happened. But the problem with the ACA is number one, there was all that period of uncertainty, remember? And then the webpage didn't work and people thought they were going to lose something and they didn't know the Democrats didn't go bold enough on on health care.",
