    "turn_text": "It's really sad because after 9-11, you know, everyone came together. When Gabby Giffords, you mentioned Arizona, when she was shot, the members came together. When Scalise was shot a few years ago, I remember collectively the house clapping on his return for whatever reason at the January 6th. You know, for a split second, we saw members saying, you know, this was a travesty, but as the days went on, you see certain members saying things like, well, if it was Black Lives Matter, I would have been scared, but this wasn't so it wasn't a big deal. So.",
